# SCSS Standards

## Critical Rules - NEVER Violate

### 1. NEVER Use Raw px Values
```scss
// ❌ NEVER do this
.component {
  font-size: 18px;
  padding: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
  gap: 16px;
  width: 300px;
}

// ✅ ALWAYS use fluid()
.component {
  font-size: fluid(16px, 18px);
  padding: fluid(16px, 24px);
  margin-bottom: fluid(24px, 32px);
  gap: fluid(12px, 16px);
  width: fluid(280px, 300px);
}
```

**Exceptions where px is allowed:**
- `1px` borders
- Box shadows
- Border radius (if design requires it)

### 2. NEVER Use @media Directly
```scss
// ❌ NEVER do this
@media (min-width: 768px) { }
@media (max-width: 768px) { }
@media screen and (min-width: 992px) { }

// ✅ ALWAYS use media-breakpoint-up()
@include media-breakpoint-up(md) { }
@include media-breakpoint-up(lg) { }
```

### 3. NEVER Use Desktop-First / media-breakpoint-down
```scss
// ❌ NEVER do this
.component {
  font-size: fluid(24px, 32px);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

  @include media-breakpoint-down(md) {
    font-size: fluid(16px, 20px);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}

// ✅ ALWAYS mobile-first
.component {
  font-size: fluid(16px, 20px);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;

  @include media-breakpoint-up(lg) {
    font-size: fluid(24px, 32px);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
}
```

## The fluid() Function

### Basic Usage
```scss
// fluid(min-size, max-size)
font-size: fluid(16px, 24px);
padding: fluid(20px, 40px);
margin-bottom: fluid(32px, 64px);
```

### With Custom Viewport Range
```scss
// fluid(min-size, max-size, min-viewport, max-viewport)
font-size: fluid(16px, 24px, 320px, 1400px);
```

### Implementation
```scss
// In abstracts/_functions.scss
@function fluid($min, $max, $min-vw: 320px, $max-vw: 1200px) {
  $min-val: strip-unit($min);
  $max-val: strip-unit($max);
  $min-vw-val: strip-unit($min-vw);
  $max-vw-val: strip-unit($max-vw);

  $slope: ($max-val - $min-val) / ($max-vw-val - $min-vw-val);
  $y-intercept: $min-val - ($slope * $min-vw-val);

  $min-rem: ($min-val / 16) * 1rem;
  $max-rem: ($max-val / 16) * 1rem;
  $preferred: ($y-intercept / 16) * 1rem + ($slope * 100vw);

  @return clamp(#{$min-rem}, #{$preferred}, #{$max-rem});
}

@function strip-unit($number) {
  @if type-of($number) == 'number' and not unitless($number) {
    @return $number / ($number * 0 + 1);
  }
  @return $number;
}
```

## Breakpoint System

### Available Breakpoints (Mobile-First ONLY)
```scss
// In abstracts/_variables.scss
$breakpoints: (
  sm: 576px,
  md: 768px,
  lg: 992px,
  xl: 1200px,
  xxl: 1400px
);

// In abstracts/_mixins.scss
@mixin media-breakpoint-up($breakpoint) {
  $value: map-get($breakpoints, $breakpoint);
  @if $value {
    @media (min-width: $value) {
      @content;
    }
  } @else {
    @warn "Breakpoint `#{$breakpoint}` not found.";
  }
}
```

### Usage Pattern
```scss
.component {
  // Mobile styles (default)
  padding: fluid(16px, 20px);

  @include media-breakpoint-up(sm) {
    // 576px and up
  }

  @include media-breakpoint-up(md) {
    // 768px and up
    padding: fluid(20px, 32px);
  }

  @include media-breakpoint-up(lg) {
    // 992px and up
    padding: fluid(32px, 48px);
  }

  @include media-breakpoint-up(xl) {
    // 1200px and up
  }
}
```

## BEM Naming Convention

### Structure
```scss
// Block
.card {
  background: $color-surface;
}

// Element (child of block)
.card__header {
  padding: fluid(16px, 24px);
}

.card__body {
  padding: fluid(20px, 32px);
}

.card__footer {
  border-top: 1px solid $color-border;
}

// Modifier (variation of block or element)
.card--featured {
  border: 2px solid $color-accent;
}

.card--compact {
  .card__body {
    padding: fluid(12px, 16px);
  }
}

.card__header--large {
  font-size: fluid(20px, 28px);
}
```

### Multi-Word Names
```scss
// Use single hyphens within block/element/modifier names
.navigation-menu { }
.navigation-menu__menu-item { }
.navigation-menu__menu-item--is-active { }

.product-card { }
.product-card__add-to-cart { }
.product-card--on-sale { }
```

## File Organization

### 7-1 Pattern
```
scss/
├── abstracts/
│   ├── _variables.scss    // Variables, colors, fonts
│   ├── _functions.scss    // fluid(), strip-unit(), etc.
│   └── _mixins.scss       // media-breakpoint-up(), etc.
├── base/
│   ├── _reset.scss        // CSS reset/normalize
│   ├── _typography.scss   // Base typography
│   └── _utilities.scss    // Utility classes
├── components/
│   ├── _buttons.scss
│   ├── _cards.scss
│   └── _forms.scss
├── layout/
│   ├── _header.scss
│   ├── _footer.scss
│   └── _grid.scss
├── pages/
│   ├── _home.scss
│   └── _single.scss
├── vendors/
│   └── _plugin-overrides.scss
└── style.scss             // Main file - imports only
```

### Import Order in style.scss
```scss
// 1. Abstracts (no CSS output)
@import 'abstracts/variables';
@import 'abstracts/functions';
@import 'abstracts/mixins';

// 2. Vendors
@import 'vendors/normalize';

// 3. Base
@import 'base/reset';
@import 'base/typography';

// 4. Layout
@import 'base/header';
@import 'base/footer';
@import 'base/grid';

// 5. Components
@import 'components/buttons';
@import 'components/cards';
@import 'components/forms';

// 6. Pages
@import 'pages/home';

// 7. Utilities (last for override capability)
@import 'base/utilities';
```

## CSS Variables Pattern

### Define in :root
```scss
:root {
  // Colors
  --color-primary: #{$color-primary};
  --color-secondary: #{$color-secondary};
  --color-accent: #{$color-accent};

  // Typography
  --font-family-base: #{$font-family-base};
  --font-family-heading: #{$font-family-heading};

  // Spacing (use fluid values)
  --spacing-sm: #{fluid(8px, 12px)};
  --spacing-md: #{fluid(16px, 24px)};
  --spacing-lg: #{fluid(32px, 48px)};
  --spacing-xl: #{fluid(48px, 80px)};
}
```

### Use in Components
```scss
.component {
  font-family: var(--font-family-base);
  padding: var(--spacing-md);
  color: var(--color-primary);
}
```

## Nesting Rules

### Maximum 3 Levels
```scss
// ✅ Good - Clean and readable
.card {
  &__header {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  &__body {
    padding: fluid(16px, 24px);
  }

  &--featured {
    border-color: $color-accent;
  }
}

// ❌ Bad - Too deep
.card {
  .card__header {
    .card__title {
      .card__title-text {
        // Too deep!
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Acceptable Deep Nesting
```scss
// Pseudo-classes and media queries don't count toward depth
.button {
  background: $color-primary;

  &:hover {
    background: darken($color-primary, 10%);
  }

  &:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid $color-accent;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @include media-breakpoint-up(md) {
    padding: fluid(16px, 24px);
  }
}
```

## Specificity Rules

### Keep It Low
```scss
// ✅ Good - Single class (specificity: 0,1,0)
.button { }
.card__title { }

// ⚠️ Use sparingly - Two classes (specificity: 0,2,0)
.card.card--featured { }

// ❌ Avoid - High specificity
#header .navigation .menu-item { }
div.card > p.text { }
```

### Never Use !important
```scss
// ❌ Never
.component {
  color: red !important;
}

// ✅ Instead, fix the specificity issue
.component {
  color: red;
}
```

## Accessibility

### Focus Styles
```scss
// Always provide visible focus
.button {
  &:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid $color-accent;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
}

// Never remove focus outlines without replacement
// ❌ Never
*:focus {
  outline: none;
}
```

### Reduced Motion
```scss
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
```

### Color Contrast
```scss
// Ensure text meets WCAG AA standards
// Normal text: 4.5:1 contrast ratio
// Large text (18pt+): 3:1 contrast ratio

$color-text: #1a1a2e;      // Dark text on light backgrounds
$color-text-light: #ffffff; // Light text on dark backgrounds
```

## Common Patterns

### Grid Layout
```scss
.grid {
  display: grid;
  gap: fluid(16px, 32px);
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;

  @include media-breakpoint-up(md) {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  @include media-breakpoint-up(lg) {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
}
```

### Flexbox Layout
```scss
.flex-container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: fluid(12px, 16px);

  @include media-breakpoint-up(md) {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
}
```

### Aspect Ratio Images
```scss
.image-container {
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  overflow: hidden;

  img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
}
```
